+Each `agent` operation owns at most one InstantDB `$stream`. Provider chunks,
+model rounds, action calls, sources, and errors are appended to that stream in
+causal order. The stream is provisional: completion persists one immutable
+`context.agent` Event with canonical Event Parts, then marks the stream done.
+Non-streaming operations do not create an empty stream.
+
